Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: pure route subtitle and privacy model for Contacts
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Pure Java under sable/ for the next patch: SableRoutes builds the line
under a contact's name from the default number and the person's other
routes ("Mobile · +1 555 0101 · Mail · Hub"), leaves the number out
while the device is locked or Sable private mode is on ("Phone · Mail ·
Hub"), says when a number can be handed to Sable Hub, and reads Sable
private mode from Hub's provider answer (no Hub: off; unexpected value:
on). The Hub intent names match sable-src 0030.
---
 .../android/contacts/sable/SableRoutes.java   | 119 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 119 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/contacts/sable/SableRoutes.java

diff --git a/src/com/android/contacts/sable/SableRoutes.java b/src/com/android/contacts/sable/SableRoutes.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..35b97d9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/com/android/contacts/sable/SableRoutes.java
@@ -0,0 +1,119 @@
